{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3672710/extras/the_game.png?t=1747066168\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">in Grizzly Golfers there is <strong>only one goal</strong> and that's to <strong>win from you friends at all cost.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3672710/extras/hitting_bears.gif?t=1747066168\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Whack</strong> them with you <strong>golfclub</strong> or <strong>steal their ball</strong>, as long as <strong>you defeat them</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3672710/extras/levels.gif?t=1747066168\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">play trough all kinds of entertaining handcrafted levels, where you and your friends can play minigolf.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3672710/extras/level_editor_2.gif?t=1747066168\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">and when you are done with those you can move on to <strong>building your own</strong> silly and challenging <strong>courses</strong> in the <strong>built-in level editor.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3672710/extras/minigames2.png?t=1747066168\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Bored?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Play minigames!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">like Street Golf with Cars</p><p class=\"b